      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "if this is still tracked, I notice this with quest worlds as well.I have a cross compatible world and due to the 100mb limit of quest, I am running out of space to do stuff, and one problem is for some reason, the quest side is roughly 10mb bigger in size than the PC side.",
